      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1b0jekd'
    '|b||And the net is whichever is longer. For a food that is only part of the budget, the swap usually wins: they still buy a little less.':
