      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1xsafvg'
    '|b||Then a higher price would make you buy more. It sounds impossible; whether it ever happens is a hunt of its own.':
