      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:to6br3'
    '|b||One thing bothers me. Nobody has ever seen point C. It''s an imaginary bundle at an imaginary income.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7280
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow'
    '|a||True. C is a thought experiment, and it hides a choice: what does ''just as well off'' mean?':
      mp3: 
