      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:y2xbbt'
    '|a||For a sma (@@)ll price change the two lin (@highlight budget_comp sline@)es almost coincide; for a big one the split shifts a little. The two effects are a way of reading the move, not two things you can photograph.':
